* SPICE library with two corner sections, pulled in by
* test_spice_include_section.sim via `include "..." section=tt`. Section tt and
* section ff give different divider ratios so the test proves the correct
* section was selected (and dispatched through the Rust adapter's
* parse_netlist_lib path).
.lib tt
.model rtt r
.endl tt
.lib ff
.model rff r
.endl ff
